sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CR as 🕒 Cron / Scheduler
    participant SP as 🕷️ Scraper (Spider)
    participant MW as 🧩 Middleware
    participant VL as 🧮 Validator
    participant PL as 🔁 Pipeline
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL
    participant LG as 📊 Logger / Monitor

    CR->>SP: Start scraping job
    SP->>MW: Fetch URL / Request page
    MW-->>SP: Response (HTML / JSON)
    SP->>VL: Emit scraped item
    VL->>PL: Validated & cleaned item
    PL->>DB: Write record
    DB-->>PL: ACK (success / fail)
    PL->>LG: Send stats (count, errors)
    LG-->>CR: Report completion summary
